  "description": "KAYSAF crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C36 H108 Nd4 O12 Si12,0.5(C7 H8). From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 5 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Nd3 (Nd) has 6 O neighbors; Nd4 (Nd) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.595-3.791 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 88.26-107.38°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Nd(OSiMe3)3]4·0.5C7H8.",
